    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so when you mention things like deregulation and tax cuts, do you think those are the main drivers, or are there other factors like automation or globalization that play a bigger role? i'm trying to figure out if it's more about policy choices or just how the global economy is changing.",
